[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5641.07, "timestamp": "01:34:01", "text": "呃，會員制度是怎麼運作的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5650.03, "timestamp": "01:34:10", "text": "？  會員資格贈送。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5653.83, "timestamp": "01:34:13", "text": "我可以自訂金額嗎？不，我很高興"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5656.79, "timestamp": "01:34:16", "text": "會員費只要29盧比。我以為會是58之類的。我很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5684.07, "timestamp": "01:34:44", "text": "高興它更便宜。所以，你覺得值得嗎？例如五人會員卡的價格是145"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5687.27, "timestamp": "01:34:47", "text": "盧比。那不就是 29 + 295 嗎？哦，145。是的，值得。  好的。更"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5690.709, "timestamp": "01:34:50", "text": "便宜。我不知道。感謝上帝。我必須盡可能降低成本。是不是代表我已經……啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5692.87, "timestamp": "01:34:52", "text": "你們還沒上來。我的天啊。會員資格。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5698.76, "timestamp": "01:34:58", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}]